            "size": 98,
            "state": "uploaded"
          }
        ],
        "body": "## What changed\n\n- Add standard, tag-pinnable Git marketplace catalogs for Codex and Claude Code.\n- Add one clean dual-host plugin payload so installation no longer requires a source build, ZIP extraction, or copying the development harness.\n- Bind the committed marketplace payload to the canonical manifests and all 12 source skills during offline distribution verification.\n- Keep every Level 7 skill byte-for-byte unchanged from v0.1.0.\n\n## Verified package hashes\n\n- Codex ZIP: `58ec422efd1b672f3c5d2aa6d1e7672077fb7741c68abcc548179c188f329dba`\n- Claude ZIP: `0a589d5566ffb6498f0501f76cd198ac0100edc3570a07f094fe1de595241c49`\n\nProvider/model invocation and formal support remain outside this release claim.",
